:: Deadwood Raven Shrine Bed
<<deadwood-raven-home-presence>>
<<if !_shrineHome or $location isnot 'raven_shrine_house'>>
  <<lanSwitch 'You cannot settle into the bedding here now.' '你现在不便在这里睡下。'>><br><br>
  <<deadwood-raven-home-return>><<exit>>
<</if>>
<<set $outside to 0>><<effects>>
<<if _shrineHomePerson>><<npc Tsukihan>><<person1>><</if>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    You draw back the quilt and settle onto the broad futon. <<if _shrineBedCompany>>Tsukihan shifts over to leave you room. <<if C.npc.Tsukihan.dom gte 70>>"You took your time." <<He>> pulls the quilt over your shoulder before settling beside you.<<else>>"Comfortable?" <<He>> smooths the quilt between you, then leaves <<his>> hand close to yours.<</if>><<elseif _shrineHomePerson>>Tsukihan is up and about, leaving you to rest.<<elseif _shrineHomeBathing>>Water splashes softly behind the washroom door. The pillow beside yours is cool.<<else>>Tsukihan is working outside. The pillow beside yours is cool.<</if>><br><br>
    <<if Weather.precipitation is 'rain'>>Rain ticks against the eaves.<<else>>The room is quiet beyond the rustle of the quilt.<</if>>
  <<option 'CN'>>
    你掀开被角，在宽褥子上躺好。<<if _shrineBedCompany>>月羽往里挪了挪，把身旁的位置让给你。<<if C.npc.Tsukihan.dom gte 70>>“怎么才来。”<<He>>先把被子拉到你的肩头，才在旁边躺稳。<<else>>“这样挤么？”<<He>>理平你们之间的被子，把手留在你的手边。<</if>><<elseif _shrineHomePerson>>月羽已经起来忙自己的事，留你在床上歇着。<<elseif _shrineHomeBathing>>浴室门后传来轻轻的水声，旁边的枕头凉凉的。<<else>>月羽还在外面忙，旁边的枕头凉凉的。<</if>><br><br>
    <<if Weather.precipitation is 'rain'>>雨点细细地敲着屋檐。<<else>>翻动被褥的窸窣声停下，屋里便安静了。<</if>>
<</language>><br><br>
<!-- 沿用原版选时、按小时睡眠与醒来结算，不替玩家脱衣或恢复衣着。 -->
<<nightmareCheck 'Deadwood Raven Shrine Sleep'>>
<<generateSleepLinks 'Deadwood Raven Shrine Sleep'>>
<<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Climb out of bed', '离开被褥'] 'Deadwood Raven Shrine Room'>><</lanLink>><br>

:: Deadwood Raven Shrine Sleep
<<deadwood-raven-home-presence>>
<<if !_shrineHome or $location isnot 'raven_shrine_house' or !Number.isInteger($sleephour) or ($sleephour isnot -1 and ($sleephour lt 1 or $sleephour gt 10))>>
  <<lanSwitch 'You are not ready to sleep here.' '你还没有在这里安顿下来。'>><br><br>
  <<deadwood-raven-home-return>><<exit>>
<</if>>
<<set _autosavehere to true, $outside to 0>>
<!-- 同床收益沿用原版。月羽不在屋内时独自睡，覆盖上个场景遗留的同床对象。 -->
<<set $bedGuest to _shrineBedCompany ? 'Tsukihan' : ''>>
<<sleep>>
<<if !_dreaming>>
  <<deadwood-raven-home-presence>>
  <<if _shrineHomeTravel and $location is 'raven_shrine_house'>>
    <<effects>><<wakingEffects $sleepHoursTotal>>
    <<if $nightmares gte 1 and $controlled is 0>>
      <<nightmareWake>>
    <<elseif !_wakingEffect>>
      <<include 'Deadwood Raven Shrine Wake'>>
    <</if>>
    <<sleepeffects>><br><br>
    <<if _shrineHome>>
      <<icon 'raven-shrine/futon.png'>><<lanLink ['Continue sleeping', '继续睡觉'] 'Deadwood Raven Shrine Bed'>><</lanLink>><br>
    <</if>>
    <<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Get up', '起床'] 'Deadwood Raven Shrine Room'>><</lanLink>><br>
  <</if>>
<</if>>
